      "question_text": "Paget's disease: lab findings?",
      "options": {
        "A": "Elevated ALP, normal Ca and PO4",
        "B": "Elevated Ca, low PO4, elevated ALP",
        "C": "Low ALP, elevated Ca",
        "D": "All normal"
      },
      "correct_answer": "A",
      "explanation": "Paget's disease (osteitis deformans): markedly elevated ALP (bone-specific), NORMAL Ca and PO4. Increased bone turnover. Complications: hearing loss, heart failure, sarcomatous transformation (1%)."
